// Pool income comparison
"真实费用" = "Real Cost";
"真实费用 =（1 − 扣池费后收益 ÷ 理论收益）× 100%；负值表示收益高于理论。PPS、PPS+ 与 FPPS 使用有统计区间的结算样本。PPLNS、PROP 根据统计期内的矿池出块和公示池费估算，并扣除出块运气：矿池自己公布的每块工作量（effort）说明这些块用了多少算力，剩下的就是池费和矿池损耗的算力。不公布每块工作量的矿池（如 PearlHash）显示「—」，数据不足或其他方案同样显示「—」。不含矿工软件抽水及转账费。PF 分别展示 PPS 与 PPLNS。PPLNS 与 PROP 需要最近 7 天内至少 5 天的数据、矿池自己公布的这段时间每个块的工作量（effort），且这段时间按矿池算力应出至少 100 个块；否则显示「—」。" = "Real cost = (1 − earnings after pool fee ÷ theoretical earnings) × 100%; negative means earnings above theory. PPS, PPS+ and FPPS use dated settlement measurements. PPLNS and PROP use the pool’s blocks and published pool fee over the sample window with block luck taken out: the pool’s own per-block effort shows how much work its blocks took, so what remains is the fee and the work the pool loses. Pools that publish no per-block effort, such as PearlHash, show “—”, as do missing data and other schemes. Software and transfer fees are excluded. PF shows PPS and PPLNS separately. PPLNS and PROP require at least 5 days of data within the last 7 days, the pool’s own per-block effort for that time, and enough pool hashrate to expect at least 100 blocks; otherwise “—” is shown.";
"真实费用取自有日期的结算样本；「≈」表示网络历史插值估算，含统计误差，不等同于矿池额外抽水。" = "Real cost uses dated settlement samples. “≈” means network history was interpolated; the result includes measurement error and does not establish extra pool commission.";

