// Real-cost explanation popover
"真实费用说明" = "Real Cost Explained";
"理论收益按样本期算力和独立链上的难度、区块奖励计算。样本日期见数值下方。" = "Theoretical earnings use the sample period’s hashrate and independently sourced on-chain difficulty and block rewards. Sample dates appear below the value.";
"「≈」表示估算，可能包含算力统计、观测缺口补估和链上历史插值误差；结果反映样本期收益折损，不等同于矿池公示手续费或额外抽水。" = "“≈” marks an estimate that may include hashrate statistics, estimated observation gaps and interpolation errors in chain history. The result measures the sample period’s earnings shortfall; it is not equivalent to the pool’s advertised fee or an additional commission.";

// Short real-cost explanation
"这是按各矿池标注的样本时间段，计算的实际结算收益相对理论收益的折损率。" = "This is the shortfall of settled earnings versus theoretical earnings over each pool’s displayed sample period.";
"这是 %@ 期间，实际结算收益相对理论收益的折损率。" = "This is the shortfall of settled earnings versus theoretical earnings during %@.";
"这是 %@ 期间按矿池出块和公示池费估算的折损率，已扣除出块运气，剩下的是池费和矿池损耗的算力。" = "This is the shortfall estimated from the pool’s blocks and published pool fee during %@, with block luck taken out: what remains is the fee and the work the pool loses.";

