/* 设置 → 安全性说明 */
"安全与隐私" = "Security & Privacy";
"安全性说明" = "Security Overview";
"自托管钱包" = "Self-custody wallet";
"助记词和私钥只在你的设备上生成和保存，交易也在本机签名。我们拿不到你的私钥，无法动用或冻结你的资产。" = "Your recovery phrase and private keys are created and kept only on your device, and transactions are signed there too. We never have your keys and cannot move or freeze your funds.";
"我们拿不到的数据" = "What we never receive";
"助记词与私钥" = "Recovery phrase and private keys";
"加密存于本机钥匙串，只属于这台设备：不同步到 iCloud，也不进备份。查看助记词和转账都要 Face ID / Touch ID 验证。" = "Encrypted in this device's Keychain and tied to this device: never synced to iCloud or included in backups. Viewing the phrase and sending funds require Face ID / Touch ID.";
"SafeTrade API 密钥" = "SafeTrade API key";
"只存在你的钥匙串里（开着 iCloud 钥匙串时由 Apple 端到端加密同步）；交易请求由 App 签名后直接发往 safetrade.com。" = "Kept only in your Keychain (synced by Apple with end-to-end encryption when iCloud Keychain is on). The app signs trading requests with it and sends them straight to safetrade.com.";
"余额与交易记录" = "Balances and transaction history";
"App 直接向区块浏览器查询，不经过我们的服务器。" = "The app looks them up directly from the block explorer, not through our server.";
"付款信息" = "Payment details";
"内购全程由 Apple 处理，我们拿不到你的付款方式和 Apple 账号。" = "In-app purchases are handled entirely by Apple. We never see your payment method or Apple Account.";
"统计与追踪" = "Analytics and tracking";
"App 里没有广告、统计或崩溃收集 SDK，也不做跨应用追踪。" = "The app has no advertising, analytics or crash-reporting SDKs and does no cross-app tracking.";
"发给我们服务器（pearlhub.net）的数据" = "Sent to our server (pearlhub.net)";
"公开数据" = "Public data";
"币价、矿池汇总和矿池费率。这些请求不带地址，也不带任何身份信息。" = "PRL price, pool overview and pool fees. These requests carry no address and no identity.";
"开启后才发送：推送令牌、提醒条件、界面语言，以及推送时段和时区。删掉全部提醒、结束盯盘后，服务器上的这些数据随之删除。" = "Sent only once you turn them on: the push token, your alert conditions, the app language, and your notification hours with their time zone. Deleting all alerts or ending the live price removes them from the server.";
"价格提醒与锁屏盯盘" = "Price alerts and Lock Screen live price";
"开启后才发送：矿池、收益地址（F2Pool 为只读页链接和账户名）、监控名称和提醒延迟。服务器会保存矿池最近报告的矿机名和在线状态，用来判断掉线；关掉提醒或删除监控后即从服务器移除。" = "Sent only once you turn it on: the pool, the payout address (for F2Pool, the read-only page link and account name), the monitor's name and the delay. The server keeps the worker names and online status the pool last reported, to detect outages. Turning the alert off or deleting the monitor removes it from the server.";
"购买后 Apple 会通知我们的服务器，服务器保存交易号、价格和国家或地区，用来处理退款。开启提醒或登录邮箱账号时，App 还会发送 Apple 签名的购买记录，用来确认高级版。" = "After a purchase, Apple notifies our server, which keeps the transaction ID, price and country or region to handle refunds. When you turn on alerts or sign in with email, the app also sends Apple's signed purchase record to confirm Pro.";
"高级版购买记录" = "Pro purchase record";
"登录后才有：服务器保存邮箱、设备名称和登录时间，并同步矿池监控、提醒、地址簿、每个钱包的名称和第一个收款地址、显卡与电费设置、语言和外观。同步数据加密存储，但不是端到端加密，服务器能读取。" = "Only if you sign in: the server keeps your email, device names and sign-in times, and syncs your pool monitors, alerts, address book, each wallet's name and first receive address, GPU and power settings, language and appearance. Synced data is encrypted at rest but not end-to-end, so the server can read it.";
"App 直接连接的第三方服务" = "Services the app contacts directly";
"blockbook.pearlresearch.ai。查余额和记录时发送钱包的扩展公钥（xpub，可据此推出这个钱包的全部地址）；转账时广播本机签好的交易。" = "blockbook.pearlresearch.ai. To show balances and history the app sends the wallet's extended public key (xpub, from which all of the wallet's addresses can be derived); to send, it broadcasts the transaction signed on this device.";
"Pearl 区块浏览器" = "Pearl block explorer";
"添加矿池监控后，App 把收益地址（F2Pool 为只读页链接）发给对应矿池。" = "For each pool monitor you add, the app sends its payout address (for F2Pool, the read-only page link) to that pool.";
"矿池公开接口" = "Mining pool APIs";
"SafeTrade、CoinGecko、WhatToMine、MiningPoolStats、open.er-api.com 等公开数据源，请求不带地址。" = "Public sources such as SafeTrade, CoinGecko, WhatToMine, MiningPoolStats and open.er-api.com. These requests carry no address.";
"行情与汇率" = "Prices and exchange rates";
"存在你设备上的数据" = "Stored on your devices";
"钱包数据库、地址簿、设置和缓存都存在本机，钱包数据库不进备份；登录凭据存于本机钥匙串。登录后还有一张登录票经 iCloud 钥匙串同步（Apple 端到端加密），你的其他设备凭它免验证码登录。" = "The wallet database, address book, settings and caches stay on this device, and the wallet database is excluded from backups. Sign-in credentials are kept in this device's Keychain. Once you sign in, a sign-in ticket also syncs through iCloud Keychain (end-to-end encrypted by Apple), so your other devices can sign in without a code.";
"本机" = "This device";
"矿池监控、提醒、地址簿、钱包名称、显卡与电费、语言和外观等设置，通过你自己的 iCloud 在你的设备间同步，我们无法访问。助记词从不同步。" = "Settings such as pool monitors, alerts, address book, wallet names, GPUs and power costs, language and appearance sync between your devices through your own iCloud, which we cannot access. The recovery phrase is never synced.";
"iCloud 同步（高级版）" = "iCloud sync (Pro)";
"开源代码" = "Open source";
