"App 先向我们自建的区块索引 node.pearlhub.net 查询，它不可用或数据落后时改用 Pearl 官方的 blockbook.pearlresearch.ai。查询时发送钱包的扩展公钥（xpub，可据此推出这个钱包的全部地址）；转账时签好的交易同时广播给两边。矿池监控的「链上到账」（发送收益地址）和全网算力图也按这个顺序查询。" = "The app asks our own blockchain index, node.pearlhub.net, first, and switches to Pearl's official blockbook.pearlresearch.ai when ours is unavailable or behind. Queries send the wallet's extended public key (xpub, from which all of the wallet's addresses can be derived); to send, the signed transaction is broadcast to both. The pools' On-chain Received figures (which send the payout address) and the network hashrate chart are queried in the same order.";
"blockbook.pearlresearch.ai。我们的索引不可用或数据落后时，App 改向它查询余额和记录（同样发送扩展公钥）；转账时签好的交易也同时广播给它。" = "blockbook.pearlresearch.ai. When our index is unavailable or behind, the app asks it for balances and history instead (also sending the extended public key); signed transactions are broadcast to it as well.";
